        <mxCell id="e11" value="any action off Windows" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;fontSize=11;jettySize=auto;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=8;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s_tpl" target="s_uns">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" value="IMT drives the set only through logman (never touches the registry). Failed or invalid input (PerfmonError::Invalid, Io, Failed) leaves the set in its previous state. logman query output is localised: only English keys are parsed, otherwise RunState is Unknown and output paths are missing. Controller is in progress: the UI and Tauri commands do not exist yet." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;fontStyle=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
